 "words": 234,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "When the night is long and the morning's slow to come",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When the news is hard and my heart is going numb",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I can't see the whole design, I only hold a thread",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But I'm standing on the word the apostle Paul once said",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.99,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And we know that in all things",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "God works for the good of those who love him",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who are called according to his purpose",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In all things, in all things",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.99,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Every closing door and every winding road",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Every empty chair and every heavy load",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The God who gave his Son for me will not forget me now",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So I lay down every worry and I let my spirit bow",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And we know that in all things",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "God works for the good of those who love him",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who are called according to his purpose",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In all things, in all things",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.92,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If God is for us, who can be against us",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who will separate us from the love of Christ",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In all these things we are more than conquerors",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Through him who loved us",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And we know that in all things",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "God works for the good of those who love him",
   "heard": 10,
